            <div xml:id="d128">

                <pb facs="0173" n="163" sameAs="frus:frus1943v01/pg163"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">548.G1/46: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul General at Hamilton</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Beck</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-04-23T23:00:00-04:00">April 23, 1943—11
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>92. Your 128, April 22, 7 p.m. For Dodds from Long. We assume that transportation
                    costs on Rumanian vessels for refugees in question proceeding to Palestine will
                    be in the neighborhood of $100,000 to $150,000. Please advise. We have arranged
                    to have funds available <pb facs="0174" n="164" xml:id="pg164"/> and are glad to
                    be able to state that the American Government will share transportation costs
                    with the British Government. Because of the nationality of the vessels involved
                    we prefer to make payment to British Government. [Long.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
